    PA -->|Status Updates| P2
    PA -->|Order Queries| P2
    
    P2 -->|Cart Data| D3
    P2 -->|Order Data| D4
    P2 -->|Status History| D5
    D3 -->|Cart Info| P2
    D4 -->|Order Info| P2
    D5 -->|History Info| P2
    D9 -->|Medicine Info| P2
    
    P2 -->|Order Events| P6
    P2 -->|Order Confirmations| SR
    P2 -->|Order Details| SR
    P2 -->|Order Details| PA
    P2 -->|Status Updates| SR
    
    %% ============================================
