    P3 -->|Payment Submissions| D6
    P3 -->|Transactions| D7
    P3 -->|Files| D8
    D6 -->|Submission Info| P3
    D7 -->|Transaction Info| P3
    D8 -->|File Info| P3
    D4 -->|Order Info| P3
    
    P3 -->|Payment Events| P6
    P3 -->|Payment Status| SR
    P3 -->|Verification Status| PA
    P3 -->|Payment Details| SR
    P3 -->|Payment Details| PA
    
